WEBVTT

00:02.258 --> 00:04.427
KATARA: Water.

00:04.844 --> 00:06.304
Earth.

00:06.596 --> 00:08.598
Fire.

00:08.890 --> 00:10.308
Air.

00:11.142 --> 00:15.104
Long ago, the four nations
lived together in harmony.

00:15.438 --> 00:19.275
Then, everything changed
when the Fire Nation attacked.

00:19.776 --> 00:22.403
Only the Avatar,
master of all four elements,

00:22.529 --> 00:23.738
could stop them.

00:23.863 --> 00:26.699
But when the world
needed him most, he vanished.

00:27.367 --> 00:29.494
A hundred years passed,
and my brother and I discovered

00:29.577 --> 00:32.664
the new Avatar, an airbender named Aang.

00:32.956 --> 00:35.166
And although
his airbending skills are great,

00:35.291 --> 00:37.585
he has a lot to learn before
he's ready to save anyone.

00:37.710 --> 00:38.920
AANG: Oof!

00:39.045 --> 00:42.006
But I believe Aang can save the world.

00:59.929 --> 01:01.890
OZAI: Come on out, Avatar!

01:02.015 --> 01:04.351
You can't hide in there forever!

01:11.483 --> 01:12.609
Toph, metalbend the rudder,

01:12.734 --> 01:14.444
so it's jammed in the turning position.

01:14.569 --> 01:16.613
The ship will spiral
and slam into the others.

01:16.738 --> 01:18.281
Got it.

01:19.949 --> 01:22.243
( SPITS )

01:22.369 --> 01:24.287
( STRAINING )

01:27.832 --> 01:28.958
CREW: ( GASPS )

01:34.464 --> 01:35.840
Have I ever mentioned how sweet it is

01:35.965 --> 01:37.717
that you invented metalbending?

01:37.842 --> 01:39.636
You could stand to mention it more.

01:48.686 --> 01:50.355
BOTH: ( SCREAMING )

01:55.318 --> 01:56.486
TOPH: ( SCREAMS )

01:56.611 --> 01:58.988
- SOKKA: Oh!
-( GRUNTS )

01:59.114 --> 02:02.075
( STRAINING )

02:02.200 --> 02:03.660
My leg!

02:03.785 --> 02:06.830
- Hang on, Toph.
- Aye-aye, Captain.

02:21.511 --> 02:23.555
-( GRUNTS )
-( SCREAMS )

02:24.597 --> 02:27.183
Bye, space sword.

02:33.731 --> 02:35.150
( STRAINING )

02:35.275 --> 02:37.569
I don't think Boomerang
is coming back, Toph.

02:37.652 --> 02:39.612
It's looks like this is the end.

02:39.821 --> 02:41.489
CREW: ( GASPING )

02:43.491 --> 02:45.535
( METAL SCRAPING )

02:50.790 --> 02:54.169
How did that happen?
Did Boomerang come back?

02:54.294 --> 02:56.296
No, Suki did.

03:34.667 --> 03:36.419
-( THUNDER CRASHING )
-( SCREAMS )

03:46.513 --> 03:50.099
Come on out, little boy.
You're about to be―

03:50.183 --> 03:51.601
( GASPS )

04:07.450 --> 04:09.452
( GRUNTING )

04:09.577 --> 04:11.871
( THUDS, GROANS )

04:19.921 --> 04:23.299
( ROARS )

04:26.594 --> 04:28.888
( GASPING )

05:06.426 --> 05:07.677
Huh!

05:11.139 --> 05:12.807
Ah!

05:15.268 --> 05:16.311
( STRAINING )

05:16.436 --> 05:18.438
( GRUNTS )

05:26.613 --> 05:29.574
( CLANKING )

05:29.699 --> 05:32.452
MEN: ( GROANING )

05:54.349 --> 05:55.808
( GROANS )

06:16.204 --> 06:17.789
( GROANS )

06:17.997 --> 06:19.374
( GASPS )

06:19.499 --> 06:20.833
( PANTING )

06:20.958 --> 06:22.168
( FLAMES ROARING )

06:22.293 --> 06:24.212
AZULA: ( LAUGHS MANIACALLY )

06:24.504 --> 06:27.423
( GROANING )

06:28.758 --> 06:30.718
( GRUNTS )

06:33.680 --> 06:35.348
I'd really rather our family physician

06:35.473 --> 06:37.975
look after little Zu Zu,
if you don't mind.

06:38.101 --> 06:39.769
( ELECTRICITY ZAPPING )

06:51.447 --> 06:54.075
AZULA: Zu Zu, you don't look so good.

06:55.118 --> 06:56.452
Hyah!

07:15.054 --> 07:16.305
( GRUNTS )

07:25.398 --> 07:27.734
There you are, filthy peasant.

07:48.129 --> 07:49.756
( WATER BUBBLING )

08:05.354 --> 08:06.773
BOTH: ( PANTING, COUGHING )

08:08.941 --> 08:10.359
( GROANS )

08:10.485 --> 08:12.904
( STRAINING )

08:14.822 --> 08:16.032
( GROANING )

08:33.132 --> 08:34.759
( SOFTLY ) Thank you, Katara.

08:35.343 --> 08:38.012
I think I'm the one
who should be thanking you.

08:41.432 --> 08:43.601
( HYPERVENTILATING )

08:44.811 --> 08:47.313
( SCREAMING )

08:50.358 --> 08:53.694
( SOBBING )

08:55.822 --> 08:58.825
( SCREAMS, SOBS CONTINUE )

09:31.107 --> 09:32.316
( GASPS )

09:36.279 --> 09:38.406
( CRASHING )

10:53.022 --> 10:54.649
( GASPS )

10:57.693 --> 10:58.903
AANG: ( IN DISTORTED VOICE ) Fire Lord Ozai,

10:59.028 --> 11:00.571
you and your forefathers

11:00.696 --> 11:02.490
have devastated the balance of this world,

11:02.615 --> 11:06.077
and now, you shall pay the ultimate price.

11:09.497 --> 11:11.999
( ROARING )

11:21.133 --> 11:23.511
( WATER SPLASHES )

11:31.811 --> 11:33.229
( GROANS )

11:40.903 --> 11:44.240
No. I am not gonna end it like this.

11:44.657 --> 11:47.201
Even with all power in the world,

11:47.410 --> 11:49.912
you are still weak.

12:09.557 --> 12:11.934
( HYPNOTIC CHANTING )

12:15.479 --> 12:19.275
LION TURTLE: In the era before the Avatar,

12:19.400 --> 12:21.736
we bent not the elements,

12:21.861 --> 12:25.406
but the energy within ourselves.

12:52.641 --> 12:54.977
( RUMBLING )

13:03.736 --> 13:06.864
LION TURTLE: To bend another's energy,

13:07.031 --> 13:11.077
your own spirit must be unbendable,

13:11.202 --> 13:15.164
or you will be corrupted and destroyed.

13:43.109 --> 13:44.819
BOTH: ( GROAN )

13:50.699 --> 13:52.076
( GRUNTS WEAKLY )

13:52.159 --> 13:53.244
( GROANS )

13:53.327 --> 13:55.788
What? What did you do to me?

13:56.247 --> 13:58.082
I took away your firebending.

13:58.165 --> 14:01.794
You can't use it to hurt or
threaten anyone else ever again.

14:09.927 --> 14:12.721
( BREATHING DEEPLY )

14:52.261 --> 14:53.929
( CHATTERING )

15:07.359 --> 15:08.944
You did it!

15:09.069 --> 15:11.071
You should've seen yourself!
It was amazing!

15:11.197 --> 15:12.531
You were all like...

15:12.615 --> 15:14.950
( IMITATES ZAPPING, PUNCHING, EXPLOSIONS )

15:15.117 --> 15:16.619
...and the Fire Lord was all like...

15:16.702 --> 15:20.039
( IMITATES GROANING, CHOKING, MOANING )

15:20.414 --> 15:24.835
So, did you, you know, finish the job?

15:25.544 --> 15:28.255
I'm still alive.

15:29.632 --> 15:30.925
I learned there was another way

15:31.008 --> 15:32.718
to defeat him and restore balance.

15:33.093 --> 15:34.470
I took his bending away.

15:34.803 --> 15:36.889
Wow, who taught you that?

15:37.056 --> 15:38.682
A giant lion turtle.

15:38.807 --> 15:41.477
You have the craziest
adventures when you disappear.

15:42.436 --> 15:44.688
Well, look at you, buster.

15:44.772 --> 15:46.065
Now that your firebending is gone,

15:46.148 --> 15:48.901
I guess we should call
you the "Loser Lord".

15:49.526 --> 15:52.404
I am the Phoenix King.

15:52.488 --> 15:54.156
-( GROANING )
-( THUDS )

15:54.490 --> 15:56.575
Oh, sorry, didn't mean to offend you,

15:56.659 --> 15:58.994
Phoenix King of getting his butt-whooped.

15:59.370 --> 16:04.792
Yeah, or how about "King of...
The Guys Who Don't Win"?

16:05.042 --> 16:06.961
Leave the nicknames to us, honey.

16:27.523 --> 16:29.316
( GROANING )

16:29.441 --> 16:31.277
You need some help with that?

16:33.904 --> 16:36.073
Mai. You're okay.

16:36.991 --> 16:38.158
They let you out of prison?

16:38.284 --> 16:40.119
My uncle pulled some strings.

16:40.244 --> 16:43.080
And it doesn't hurt when
the new Fire Lord is your boyfriend.

16:43.163 --> 16:45.332
So, does this mean you
don't hate me anymore?

16:45.416 --> 16:48.919
I think it means
I actually kind of like you.

16:53.340 --> 16:56.635
But don't ever break up with me again.

17:05.978 --> 17:07.813
CROWD: ( MURMURING )

17:13.193 --> 17:14.653
- Dad!
- Dad!

17:18.657 --> 17:20.409
I heard what you two did.

17:20.743 --> 17:24.580
I am the proudest father in the world.

17:24.705 --> 17:27.875
And your mother would be proud, too.

17:29.918 --> 17:31.754
SOKKA: There's my favorite warriors.

17:31.879 --> 17:33.756
I have to admit,
I kinda missed the face paint.

17:33.964 --> 17:36.133
So, how's it feel to be
back in uniform again?

17:36.425 --> 17:38.010
It feels great!

17:39.720 --> 17:40.929
Careful, Suki!

17:41.096 --> 17:43.724
Ty Lee's pretending to be
a Kyoshi Warrior again.

17:44.099 --> 17:45.225
It's okay.

17:45.351 --> 17:46.435
She's one of us now.

17:46.560 --> 17:48.228
( YELPS )

17:48.354 --> 17:50.939
Yeah, the girls and I
really bonded in prison

17:51.106 --> 17:52.941
and after a few chi-blocking lessons,

17:53.067 --> 17:54.651
they said I could join their group.

17:54.777 --> 17:57.488
We're gonna be best friends forever.

18:06.080 --> 18:08.165
I can't believe a year ago
my purpose in life

18:08.248 --> 18:10.084
was hunting you down and now...

18:10.501 --> 18:11.877
And now we're friends.

18:12.628 --> 18:15.506
Yeah. We are friends.

18:16.173 --> 18:19.134
I can't believe a year ago
I was still frozen in a block of ice.

18:19.593 --> 18:21.428
The world's so different now.

18:21.762 --> 18:24.223
And it's gonna be even more different.

18:24.431 --> 18:26.475
We'll rebuild it together.

18:37.152 --> 18:38.821
( GONG RINGING )

18:42.032 --> 18:44.910
CROWD: ( CHEERING )

18:45.244 --> 18:47.788
Please, the real hero...

18:47.913 --> 18:49.039
Is the Avatar.

18:51.917 --> 18:53.669
( CHEERING )

19:02.344 --> 19:05.931
ZUKO: Today, this war is finally over!

19:06.306 --> 19:09.852
( CHEERING )

19:10.144 --> 19:11.770
I promised my uncle that I would restore

19:11.895 --> 19:15.023
the honor of the Fire Nation, and I will.

19:15.357 --> 19:17.651
The road ahead of us is challenging.

19:17.985 --> 19:22.114
A hundred years of fighting
has left the world scarred and divided.

19:22.781 --> 19:24.533
But with the Avatar's help,

19:24.616 --> 19:26.910
we can get it back on the right path,

19:26.994 --> 19:30.706
and begin a new era of love and peace.

19:37.087 --> 19:40.340
All hail Fire Lord Zuko!

19:40.466 --> 19:42.801
CROWD: ( CHEERING )

20:18.712 --> 20:20.923
I should count myself lucky...

20:21.215 --> 20:23.342
The new Fire Lord has
graced me with his presence

20:23.467 --> 20:25.344
in my lowly prison cell.

20:25.594 --> 20:26.803
You should count yourself lucky

20:26.929 --> 20:29.348
that the Avatar spared your life.

20:29.765 --> 20:31.058
Hmm...

20:31.183 --> 20:33.852
Banishing me was the best thing
you could have done for my life.

20:34.186 --> 20:36.146
It put me on the right path.

20:37.314 --> 20:40.067
Perhaps your time in here
can do the same for you.

20:40.817 --> 20:43.445
Why are you really here?

20:43.570 --> 20:45.489
Because you're gonna tell me something.

20:47.783 --> 20:50.285
Where is my mother?

20:57.876 --> 20:59.920
( GRUNT OF EFFORT )

21:02.631 --> 21:04.174
( LAUGHING )

21:05.259 --> 21:07.636
APPA: ( GRUMBLING )

21:08.303 --> 21:12.099
( PLAYING CALMING MUSIC )

21:12.224 --> 21:13.684
( STOPS PLAYING )

21:16.979 --> 21:19.147
( MUSIC RESUMES )

21:20.857 --> 21:22.776
Zuko, stop moving!

21:22.901 --> 21:25.195
I'm trying to capture the moment.

21:26.029 --> 21:27.531
I wanted to do a painting,

21:27.656 --> 21:29.658
so we'd always remember
the good times together.

21:29.783 --> 21:32.244
That's very thoughtful of you, Sokka.

21:32.369 --> 21:35.038
Wait, why did you give me Momo's ears?

21:35.163 --> 21:36.748
SOKKA: Those are your hair loopies.

21:37.165 --> 21:39.585
At least you don't look like a porcupine.

21:39.668 --> 21:41.712
My hair is not that spiky.

21:41.795 --> 21:43.088
SUKI: I look like a man.

21:43.171 --> 21:45.257
TOPH: And why did you
paint me firebending?

21:45.507 --> 21:48.677
I thought it looked
more exciting that way.

21:48.760 --> 21:51.096
Oh, you think you could do
a better job, Momo?

21:51.471 --> 21:53.348
MOMO: ( CHATTERING )

21:53.765 --> 21:56.435
IROH: Hey, my belly
is not that big anymore...

21:56.560 --> 21:58.020
I've really trimmed down.

21:58.145 --> 22:00.022
TOPH: Well, I think you all look perfect!

22:00.147 --> 22:01.440
ALL: ( LAUGHING )

23:09.091 --> 23:11.093
( CLOSING THEME PLAYING )
